<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 90,000, and Yr ago 99,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Tuesday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
